  "findings": [
    "Publisher Oculus 1.8.0 and Embeddium 0.2.10 load publisher BSL 10.1.2, and the active scenes visibly show BSL rendering.",
    "Ghost and Wraith shader-off controls visibly change to vanilla rendering; restored controls visibly return to BSL rendering, matching the recorded live active/false/active state sequence.",
    "Ghost and Wraith identities and geometry are visible in day, night, native rain, dark-background, bright-background, and indoor scenes.",
    "Movement pairs visibly change entity position; native damage frames show the expected red hurt tint.",
    "Normal invisibility removes entity geometry while particles remain; spectator translucency is visible on white controls; native outlines are visible.",
    "Seven registered block surfaces and lit-state changes, worn armor and enchanted glint, inventory previews, projectiles, and the populated Spectral Infuser GUI are present and legible."
  ],
